    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271828</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>………………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271872</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あの……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Umm...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271928</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>はい……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271980</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>平気……ですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Are you...okay?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272044</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何が……ですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What...do you mean?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272132</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ずいぶん……悲しそうな
目をしてらしたので、
その……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Your eyes seem really sad,
so I just thought, maybe...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふふ……私が……
川に飛び込むか、と……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Haha... Like, maybe I'd...
throw myself into the river?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう、ね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Maybe...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272316</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>な、困ったことが
あるんなら、話聞くぜ、
おねーさん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, lady, if you've
got problems, we'll
hear you out.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272400</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……そう、ね……
聞いてくれるかしら</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Maybe...I should try
talking about it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272444</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え、ええ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, sure.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私の母はもう
余命いくばくもないの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My mother doesn't have
much longer left to live.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>大きな町のちゃんとした
お医者さんなら
治せるかもしれないけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If we could see one of the good
doctors from a bigger city, they
might be able to cure her, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……おまけに私も……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...And on top of it, I'm ill, too...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272704</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうだ……
あなたたちにお願いを
してもいいかしら？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Oh, you could...
Would you be willing to
do something for me?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272748</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お願い？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What is it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272988</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Red&gt;ローンヴァレイ&lt;White&gt;に生えている
花を摘んできてほしいの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'd like you to pick one of the
flowers from &lt;Red&gt;Lone Valley&lt;White&gt; and
bring it back to me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272988</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……小さい頃、母がたくさん、
摘んでくれた白い花、
花飾りを作って遊んだ白い花</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...When I was little, my mother picked
a lot of those white flowers. We made
necklaces and crowns from them.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272988</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……それは私と母の
思い出の花よ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...For my mother and me, that
flower is full of memories.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272988</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お願い、
ティアの花を私に……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Please, bring me
a Tear's Flower...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273080</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Red&gt;ローンヴァレイ&lt;White&gt;に、
ティアの花、だな。
うん、わかった！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A Tear's Flower,
from &lt;Red&gt;Lone Valley&lt;White&gt;.
Alright, got it!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273172</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Red&gt;ローンヴァレイ&lt;White&gt;の奥の方に
生えているはずよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They should be growing
deep in &lt;Red&gt;Lone Valley&lt;White&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あの人……大丈夫、かな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I wonder...if she's going to be okay...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273320</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うん……でも、
花を持ってくれば
元気出してくれるかも</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, same...but, she'll
probably cheer up if we
bring her that flower.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273376</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>思い出の花、だもんね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>'Cause it's full of memories.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273436</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>行こ、&lt;Red&gt;ローンヴァレイ&lt;White&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Let's go to &lt;Red&gt;Lone Valley&lt;White&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
